<title>USA: Hillsdale Cty BA, Mich., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Hillsdale Cty BA, Mich., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said it won $2 million of Hillsdale Cty Building Authority, Mich., building authority lease rental revenue bonds, Sereis 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.60 percent.</p>
</text>
